# Purpose

This document defines the LINE Official Account (LINE OA) engineering standards for the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to establish architectural principles for delivering business capabilities through LINE OA while preserving workflow consistency, business integrity, and a unified product experience.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Customer interaction philosophy
* Channel architecture
* Business capability exposure
* Communication consistency
* LINE OA governance
* Interaction evolution

It intentionally excludes LINE Messaging API, webhooks, rich menus, authentication technologies, messaging formats, and implementation-specific LINE platform features, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to customer interactions delivered through LINE OA, ensuring business capabilities remain consistent regardless of interaction channel.

